cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Seller AI Copilot - reproducibility supplement"
abstract: >-
  Synthetic experiments (original and revised controls, runner, verification
  script, per-seed results and primary fraud scores) for the manuscript
  "Engineering Financial Trust in Seller AI Copilots". Reference environment
  Python 3.12.14, NumPy 2.3.5. No language model executes in this code and no
  private or production data is used. Release v1.0.0 does not contain the
  revised experiments.
